    "explanationEn": "The context of this question refers to contact points in Germany for problems in raising children. In Germany, there are various authorities and institutions with different tasks. The question examines which institution is responsible when parents need support, advice or help with educational issues, and requires basic knowledge of the German social and administrative system.",
