      "explanationEn": "The question relates to the recognition of official emblems of German cities. The Free and Hanseatic City of Hamburg has its own coat of arms, which reflects its history, its status as a city-state and its importance as a port city. In the task, several images of coats of arms are shown, and it is necessary to decide which of them belongs to Hamburg. Knowledge of German city coats of arms or visual features can help.",
